TwDqQ","user":{"login":"swinslow","id":678569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3ODU2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/678569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow","html_url":"https://github.com/swinslow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-01-26T14:40:18Z","updated_at":"2023-01-26T14:40:18Z","body":"+1 to add. This is a broadly permissive license, similar to [OGL-UK-3.0](https://spdx.org/licenses/OGL-UK-3.0.html) as @robbiemorrison noted, but sufficiently different that it shouldn't be combined with OGL-UK-3.0 via markup. (For example, this one appears to omit the OGL-UK-3.0 additional provision beginning with \"If the Information Provider does not provide a specific attribution statement..\")\r\n\r\nWe've generally been less stringent for looking to degree of usage when it comes to adding officially-blessed governmental licenses, so I'm +1 to add even though this is drafted so as to be used solely by the UK Parliament as licensor (\"'Information Provider' means either House of Parliament.\")\r\n\r\nI'm good with the ID @robbiemorrison proposed.\r\n\r\nAlthough I don't feel strongly about it, I would probably omit \"United Kingdom\" from the name, since the license author doesn't use that and we currently don't have another \"Open Parliament License\" on the list that it would be confused with. We also don't currently include \"United Kingdom\" in the names for the various OGL-UK- licenses. ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1405106832/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1480565323","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1788#issuecomment-1480565323","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1788","id":1480565323,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85YP6JL","user":{"login":"jlovejoy","id":5048659,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDg2NTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5048659?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy","html_url":"https://github.com/jlovejoy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-03-23T03:56:57Z","updated_at":"2023-03-23T03:56:57Z","body":"note: a PR has been made for this license (ahead of a decision) as practice for GSoC students. if we accept, then we can use the PR :)","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-X